      <chord name="F#m"/>And <chord name="Bm"/>find <chord name="A7/G"/>Thy mercy <chord name="Em"/>waiting <chord name="F#m"/>at our <chord name="Em"/>side.
      </lines>
    </verse>
    <verse name="v3">
      <lines>
      <chord name="A"/>In <chord name="Bm"/>pity <chord name="A7/G"/>look <chord name="D"/>upon <chord name="F#m"/>Thy <chord name="G"/>children&#x27;s <chord name="Em"/>striving<br/>
      <chord name="D"/>For <chord name="Bm/F#"/>life <chord name="D"/>and freedom, <chord name="Bm"/>peace <chord name="F#m/C#"/>and brotherhood,<br/>
